    "content_text": "India’s long festival season is marked by the gift of giving. The various festivals have as an underlying objective compassion and care for fellow beings.\nBut what is “care” all about? The simple-sounding four-letter word carries depth and meaning. “Take care” is a commonly used phrase in daily interactions. Care is most commonly paired with health, bringing a broad lens of care to that perspective. “Childcare” has been in vogue for some time, while “senior care” or “elder care” is a relatively new concept.\nPublished\n- November 15, 2026 05:38 am IST\nCopy link\nEmail\nFacebook\nTwitter\nTelegram\nLinkedIn\nWhatsApp\nReddit\nREAD LATER\nSEE ALL\nRemove",
