    "title": "Strong sense of smell",
    "subtitle": null,
    "author": "Buddhadev Nandi",
    "published_at": null,
    "image_url": null,
    "image_caption": null,
    "content_html": "<div class=\"articlebodycontent col-xl-9 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12\" id=\"content-body-71694193\"><div class=\"schemaDiv\" id=\"schemaDiv\"><p><span class=\"drop-caps\">I</span>n our small town, it is a common sight to see a pack of stray dogs chasing motorcyclists. Sometimes the riders lose control over their vehicles and even meet with serious accidents. Some of them are bitten by the canines.</p><p>Very often, it is advised that such a situation should be dealt with calmly. The rider should stop his vehicle instead of scooting away. If it is thought that the dogs will run scared, it will be a gross mistake. One day while riding with a friend, I was chased by dog. No sooner did I stop the motorbike than a dog bit my friend in his right leg.</p></div><div class=\"articleblock-container\" id=\"arthardpv\"></div><div class=\"update-publish-time article-published-time-end\"><p class=\"publish-time-new\"> Published <span>- November 15, 2026 05:23 am IST</span></p></div><div class=\"comments-shares share-page flex print-hide\" data-artid=\"71694193\" data-title=\"Strong sense of smell\" data-url=\"https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/open-page/strong-sense-of-smell/article71694193.ece\"><div class=\"left\"><div class=\"share\"><button class=\"btn share-btn\" data-ga-labelclick=\"ArticleShare\"></button><ul class=\"share-list bottom\" style=\"display: none;\"><li class=\"copy-link\" data-cf-modified-9218464a65a918229ce3270c-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; copytext('https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/open-page/strong-sense-of-smell/article71694193.ece');\">\n                Copy link  \n                        \n            </li><li class=\"email\"><a href=\"mailto:?subject=Strong%20sense%20of%20smell&amp;amp;body=Check%20out%20this%20link%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thehindu.com%2Fopinion%2Fopen-page%2Fstrong-sense-of-smell%2Farticle71694193.ece\" target=\"_self\">\n                    Email     \n                       