    "content_text": "I\nn our small town, it is a common sight to see a pack of stray dogs chasing motorcyclists. Sometimes the riders lose control over their vehicles and even meet with serious accidents. Some of them are bitten by the canines.\nVery often, it is advised that such a situation should be dealt with calmly. The rider should stop his vehicle instead of scooting away. If it is thought that the dogs will run scared, it will be a gross mistake. One day while riding with a friend, I was chased by dog. No sooner did I stop the motorbike than a dog bit my friend in his right leg.\nPublished\n- November 15, 2026 05:23 am IST\nCopy link\nEmail\nFacebook\nTwitter\nTelegram\nLinkedIn\nWhatsApp\nReddit\nREAD LATER\nSEE ALL\nRemove",
