    "title": "Technological mindlessness",
    "subtitle": null,
    "author": "V.P. Durai",
    "published_at": null,
    "image_url": null,
    "image_caption": null,
    "content_html": "<div class=\"articlebodycontent col-xl-9 col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-12\" id=\"content-body-71694164\"><div class=\"schemaDiv\" id=\"schemaDiv\"><p><span class=\"drop-caps\">I</span> have had a passion for driving since my salad days. Just a few months after celebrating my 18th birthday, I obtained my driving licence, which was a booklet then and has now metamorphosed into a digital card. Every time I got behind the wheel, I felt exhilarated. This exhilaration took more than a decade to wane, and now it is more of a mechanical deed.</p><p>To date, I would have driven more than two lakh kilometres, covering vast stretches of Tamil Nadu, from driving through the heavily congested traffic lanes of Chennai to the narrowest streets of Kanyakumari district, where I lived for more than a decade. Incidentally, I found my driving licence had expired a year and a half ago and was anguished over the fact that I had been driving far and wide without a valid licence. Regretting my fault, I tried to renew my licence through the Sarathi-Parivahan site. Finding it a bit difficult to comprehend, I approached an agent who helped me apply online. He then advised me to book the appointment slot myself.</p></div><div class=\"articleblock-container\" id=\"arthardpv\"></div><div class=\"update-publish-time article-published-time-end\"><p class=\"publish-time-new\"> Published <span>- November 15, 2026 05:08 am IST</span></p></div><div class=\"comments-shares share-page flex print-hide\" data-artid=\"71694164\" data-title=\"Technological mindlessness\" data-url=\"https://www.thehindu.com/opinion/open-page/technological-mindlessness/article71694164.ece\"><div class=\"left\"><div class=\"share\"><button class=\"btn share-btn\" data-ga-labelclick=\"ArticleShare\"></button><ul class=\"share-list bottom\" style=\"display: none;\"><li class=\"copy-link\" data-cf-modified-0f62f08499267d9c11864312-=\"\" onclick=\"if (!window.__cfRLUnblockHandlers) return false; copytext('